<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE FOURTH STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-DAUPHINE LIBERE FOURTH STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BEDARRIDES, France 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in</p>
<p>the fourth stage of the Dauphine Libere cycling race, a 45-km</p>
<p>time trial, on Thursday:</p>
<p> 1. Vyacheslav Yekimov (Russia) US Postal		53 minutes</p>
<p>								    2.57 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Abraham Olano (Spain) Banesto			  53:36.43</p>
<p> 3. Roland Meier (Switzerland) Post Suisse	     54:29.46</p>
<p> 4. Udo Bolts (Germany) Telekom			    54:30.50</p>
<p> 5. Chris Boardman (Britain) GAN			   55:02.69</p>
<p> 6. Pascal Lance (France) Big Mat			  55:03.49</p>
<p> 7. Gilles Maignan (France) Mutuelle Seine-et-Marne  55:13.47</p>
