<p> 9. Jose Vicente Garcia (Spain) Banesto		  55:21.59</p>
<p> 10. Christophe Moreau (France) Festina		  55:33.91</p>
<p>Overall standings:</p>
<p> 1. Yekimov			  16 hours 56 minutes 10 seconds</p>
